            {
              "id": "8dd6c95f-2cbb-36c9-8aa7-36c1428d6ff8",
              "name": "Bracket Notation Object Injection Vulnerability through Math.floor((Math.random() * 3))",
              "helpUri": "https://www.glog.ai/",
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Description\n\nThe \"Bracket Notation Object Injection Vulnerability through Math.floor((Math.random() * 3))\" is a type of security vulnerability in JavaScript that occurs when user-supplied input is used to construct property accessors using bracket notation. This can lead to arbitrary property access or modification, potentially leading to unauthorized access to sensitive data or even remote code execution.\n\nIn the provided code snippet, the vulnerability arises from the use of `Math.floor((Math.random() * 3))` as an index to access elements from the `operators` array. If an attacker can control the `operators` array, they could potentially inject malicious code.\n\n## Mitigation Advice\n\nTo mitigate this vulnerability, avoid using user-supplied input to construct property accessors. If this is unavoidable, ensure that the input is properly sanitized and validated before use. \n\n## Source Code Fix Recommendation\n\nAssuming `operators` is an array of valid operators, a safer way to select a random operator would be:\n\n```javascript\nconst firstOperator = operators[Math.floor(Math.random() * operators.length)];\n```\n\nThis ensures that the index is always within the bounds of the `operators` array, reducing the risk of an out-of-bounds access vulnerability.\n\n## Library Dependencies\n\nThe provided code snippet does not appear to require any external library dependencies to execute properly.\n\n## OWASP and CWE Resources\n\n- [OWASP Top Ten 2017: Injection](https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/2017/A1_2017-Injection)\n- [CWE-74: Improper Neutralization of Special Elements in Output Used by a Downstream Component ('Injection')](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/74.html)\n\nPlease note that the links provided are subject to change and may not be accessible at a future date."
              },
              "properties": {
                "cwe": [
                  {
                    "id": "CWE-74",
                    "url": "https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/74.html"
